# Build context for apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile (run from the repo root).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
.claude
.gcloud
docs
infra

# Secrets never go into an image — configuration comes from the runtime environment.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
